Share.Expired=This link has expired. Create a new one to share it again.
Share.Ready=Choose access, then create the link.
Share.Active=The link is active.
Share.ServerControlledStatus=Availability and authentication are determined by server ACLs.
Share.ActiveUntil=The link is active until %s.
Share.ActiveNoLaterThan=The link expires no later than %s; temporary credentials can end it sooner.
Share.Copied=The full link was copied to the clipboard.
Share.Canceled=The sharing operation was canceled.
