Share.CreateTitle= Creating share link
Share.Creating=Creating or updating access...
Share.CreateFailed=The link could not be created.
Share.RevokeTitle= Revoke share link
Share.RevokeConfirm=People using this link will lose access. Revoke it?
Share.Revoking=Revoking link access...
Share.RevokeFailed=The link could not be revoked.
Share.ReconcileTitle= Checking final state
Share.Reconciling=Checking whether the link is active...
Share.StateTitle= Share-link result
Share.StateUnknown=The final share-link state is still unknown.
Share.UnexpectedAccess=The server reports a link with different access or lifetime. Review it before copying.
Share.ReconciledCopied=The server reports an active link; it was copied to the clipboard.
Share.RevokeStillActive=The server reports that the link is still active.
Share.SelectOne=Select exactly one file or folder to share.
Share.NotAvailable=Not available
Share.Notice.Public=Anyone who obtains this link can use the selected access. Send it only to people you trust.
Share.Notice.Google=Google Drive links do not expire. Anyone who obtains the link can use the selected access until it is revoked.
Share.Notice.GoogleDiscoverable=The current permission also makes this item discoverable; updating it will switch a direct grant to link-only access.
Share.Notice.GoogleInheritedDiscoverable=An inherited permission makes this item discoverable in search; change that permission on its parent.
Share.Notice.GoogleInherited=Public access is inherited from a parent and cannot be reduced below that inherited level or fully revoked on this item.
Share.Notice.GoogleReadOnly=Your current Google Drive permissions do not allow changing this link.
Share.Notice.GooglePublished=A Google Workspace published view also exposes this item. Manage or stop that publication in its Google editor.
Share.UnmanagedAccess=No manageable link; separate public access exists
Share.UnmanagedStatus=Other public access is controlled by the provider.
Share.Notice.Yandex=Yandex.Disk creates a permanent public viewer/download link. Editing, passwords and expiration are not available through its API.
Share.Notice.S3=This is a temporary signed bearer URL for one S3 object. An Uploader URL can repeatedly replace that exact object until it expires; its PutObject permission is checked only when used. The URL cannot be revoked individually, and S3 prefixes cannot be shared as folders. Previously created URLs cannot be listed and may still be active.
Share.Notice.WebDAV=Generic WebDAV has no standard public-link API. This direct address contains no CloudFox credentials; whether browser access is public or requires authentication is determined by the server's resource and method ACLs. Vendor-specific public links must be created by that server.
Share.Notice.WebDAVAnonymous=This WebDAV connection already permits anonymous access. The direct address contains no CloudFox credentials, but it is existing server access—not a separately revocable or expiring token link.
Share.ErrorTitle= Share error
Share.ErrorGeneric=The sharing operation failed.
